{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1438","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Yurii Can Do Everything"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yurii is sure he can do everything. Can he solve this task, though?"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"He has an array $$$a$$$ consisting of $$$n$$$ positive integers. Let's call a subarray $$$a[l...r]$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if the following conditions are simultaneously satisfied: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$l+1 \\leq r-1$$$, i. e. the subarray has length at least $$$3$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$(a_l \\oplus a_r) = (a_{l+1}+a_{l+2}+\\ldots+a_{r-2}+a_{r-1})$$$, where $$$\\oplus$$$ denotes the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#XOR"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise XOR operation"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In other words, a subarray is good if the bitwise XOR of the two border elements is equal to the sum of the rest of the elements. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yurii wants to calculate the total number of good subarrays. What is it equal to?"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"An array $$$c$$$ is a subarray of an array $$$d$$$ if $$$c$$$ can be obtained from $$$d$$$ by deletion of several (possibly, zero or all) elements from the beginning and several (possibly, zero or all) elements from the end."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$3 \\leq n \\leq 2\\cdot 10^5$$$) — the length of $$$a$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1,a_2,\\ldots,a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq a_i \\lt 2^{30}$$$) — elements of $$$a$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a single integer — the number of good subarrays. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n8\n3 1 2 3 1 2 3 15\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n10\n997230370 58052053 240970544 715275815 250707702 156801523 44100666 64791577 43523002 480196854\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are $$$6$$$ good subarrays in the example: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[3,1,2]$$$ (twice) because $$$(3 \\oplus 2) = 1$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[1,2,3]$$$ (twice) because $$$(1 \\oplus 3) = 2$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[2,3,1]$$$ because $$$(2 \\oplus 1) = 3$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[3,1,2,3,1,2,3,15]$$$ because $$$(3 \\oplus 15) = (1+2+3+1+2+3)$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"1438E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1438/problem/E"}